---
import Container from "../components/layout/Container.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ModelComparison from "../components/ModelComparison.astro";
import { withBasePath } from "../lib/sitePaths";
---

<BaseLayout title="Models and body patterns | Shen Europe"
  description="Explore Samuel Shen double bass models by construction. Compare body shapes at a shared scale and find individual instruments available to try.">
  <section class="model-guide" id="complete-range">
    <Container>
      <header class="guide-heading">
        <h1 class="page-title">Models</h1>
        <p class="intro">Explore by construction. Pin a model to compare its shape with the others.</p>
      </header>
      <ModelComparison />
      <div class="guide-notes">
        <div>
          <h2 class="subsection-title">From a model to an individual bass</h2>
          <p>The model guide describes the range, not stock availability.
            The photographs and playing notes on each instrument page refer to that particular bass.</p>
          <a href={withBasePath("/available")} class="quiet-link">View available instruments</a>
        </div>
        <details class="name-guide">
          <summary>Model names and SB numbers</summary>
          <div class="expanded-copy">
            <dl class="name-example">
              <div><dt>Model level</dt><dd>SB-800</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Body pattern</dt><dd>Shen Classic</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Size</dt><dd>3/4</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <p>The SB number identifies a construction and specification level. Wood selection,
              components and the work involved matter; their exact combination depends on the model and instrument.</p>
            <p>In the US Rogeri maple description, SB-200, SB-300 and SB-800 distinguish progressively
              stronger maple figuring. That is one catalogue distinction, not a complete specification or a sound ranking.</p>
            <a href="https://cscproducts.com/products/bass-rogeri-maple.html" class="quiet-link">US Rogeri model reference</a>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .model-guide { padding-block:2.5rem 4rem; }
  .guide-heading { margin-bottom:2.5rem; }
  .intro { margin-top:.85rem; color:var(--color-muted); font-size:.9375rem; line-height:1.7; }
  .guide-notes { display:grid; gap:2rem; border-top:1px solid var(--color-border); margin-top:2.5rem; padding-top:2rem; }
  .guide-notes p { margin-top:1rem; color:#666; font-size:.875rem; line-height:1.8; }
  .guide-notes .quiet-link { margin-top:1rem; }
  .name-guide { font-size:.8125rem; color:#666; }
  .name-example { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto auto auto; justify-content:start; gap:1.25rem; margin-bottom:1rem; padding-bottom:1rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .name-example div { display:flex; flex-direction:column-reverse; gap:.5rem; }
  .name-example dd { font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:1.125rem; line-height:1.3; color:#222; }
  .name-example dt { font-size:.6875rem; color:#777; }
  summary { cursor:pointer; width:fit-content; }
  .expanded-copy { margin-top:1rem; }
  a:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #171717; outline-offset:5px; }
  @media (max-width:639px) { .model-guide { padding-top:1.5rem; } .guide-heading { margin-bottom:1.5rem; } }
  @media (min-width:768px) { .guide-notes { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:4rem; } }
</style>
